<title>UK: Rheinische Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark August 2003 bond.</title>
<headline>Rheinische Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark August 2003 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Bayerische Vereinsbank, Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and Dresdner Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RHEINISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.5	 MATURITY    26.AUG.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  97.765    PAY DATE  S-26.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  27.5 BP   REOFFER    =	   S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> MGT/UND    6 BP	SELL CONC  21.5 BP   PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 734</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
